    "Registered CPU draws verify every pixel at 1920x1080 and 2880x1800 through real Windows allocations, submission ordering, same-adapter legacy and NT sharing. The 24 draws transfer 1393557504 staging-copy bytes, upload 740275200 image bytes, and copy 696729600 input and 348364800 output bytes through the provider. This is correctness validation, not a performance benchmark.",
